WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:10.010
[theme music]

00:22.022 --> 00:24.482
[somber music]

00:34.909 --> 00:36.077
[Pildo] What's your name?

00:43.793 --> 00:45.462
What's your actual name?

01:00.977 --> 01:02.062
[sighs]

01:04.564 --> 01:05.857
Send my message.

01:14.240 --> 01:15.867
[breathes deeply]

01:20.080 --> 01:21.706
[groans]

01:24.125 --> 01:26.336
[machine beeping]

01:28.713 --> 01:31.299
[breathes heavily]

01:33.635 --> 01:34.636
[groans]

01:35.220 --> 01:37.514
[panting]

01:40.683 --> 01:42.060
I don't need you.

01:45.522 --> 01:47.148
I'm not here to help you.

01:51.152 --> 01:53.446
Mr. Choi asked me to give you a message.

01:57.117 --> 01:59.410
You won't end up in prison, I promise.

02:03.540 --> 02:04.707
Come back to me.

02:15.093 --> 02:16.386
[Ms. Kang] You were hurt.

02:20.723 --> 02:22.183
[door opens]

02:23.351 --> 02:25.186
My client needs medical help.

02:25.270 --> 02:26.229
[Daesoo] What?

02:26.312 --> 02:27.272
[Daesoo sighs]

02:27.355 --> 02:29.899
Our captain is still in a coma, lady.

02:30.483 --> 02:32.318
[Ms. Kang] Should I submit
a formal complaint?

02:32.402 --> 02:34.737
I'd worry about yourself first before her.

02:35.488 --> 02:37.157
You should cut your losses.

02:38.741 --> 02:42.203
Bring me documents on Dongcheon,
and we'll request mitigation.

02:42.287 --> 02:45.331
The reporters seem to be curious
about what happened.

02:46.916 --> 02:50.712
If we say there was
a Dongcheon mole in Narcotics,

02:51.546 --> 02:52.839
that would be news.

02:55.175 --> 02:57.177
[phone clicking]

03:05.727 --> 03:07.729
[tense music]

03:25.914 --> 03:28.124
[engine revving]

03:35.673 --> 03:36.674
Hey.

03:38.509 --> 03:40.178
She left for the hospital.

03:45.892 --> 03:46.893
Bring her to me.

03:48.061 --> 03:49.270
[gangsters] Yes, sir.

03:53.524 --> 03:55.610
[suspenseful music]

04:02.450 --> 04:04.827
[police siren blaring]

04:29.769 --> 04:31.896
[handcuffs clinking]

04:46.494 --> 04:53.376
WARD 15

04:53.459 --> 04:56.254
[cell phone vibrates]

04:58.214 --> 04:59.215
Captain?

05:00.049 --> 05:01.092
[Cha Giho] Pildo.

05:04.220 --> 05:06.014
I'm at the hospital. I'll come over.

05:06.806 --> 05:08.599
- Is he awake?
- Yes.

05:08.683 --> 05:09.684
- I'll be right back.
- Yeah.

05:09.767 --> 05:10.768
Wait here. Okay.

05:16.357 --> 05:17.442
[Jiwoo groans]

05:19.444 --> 05:20.445
[nurse] This will hurt.

05:20.528 --> 05:21.487
Stay calm.

05:21.571 --> 05:22.530
[Jiwoo groans]

05:22.613 --> 05:23.531
[doctor] Cut.

05:25.366 --> 05:26.409
Mm.

05:26.492 --> 05:27.493
[Jiwoo groans]

05:29.871 --> 05:31.456
- [doctor] Help me.
- [nurse] Mm.

05:33.207 --> 05:34.250
[Jiwoo groans]

05:44.969 --> 05:47.472
[breathes heavily]

05:52.435 --> 05:53.770
[doctor] Can you cut this?

05:54.479 --> 05:55.480
[nurse] Yes.

05:58.024 --> 05:59.025
[doctor] Mm.

06:01.611 --> 06:02.945
[doctor] Get me the dressing band.

06:03.529 --> 06:05.698
Um… Band.

06:06.282 --> 06:08.117
- [nurse] Sorry. I'll go get it.
- [doctor] Right.

06:11.454 --> 06:12.997
[medical gloves twang]

06:14.874 --> 06:16.876
[indistinct chatter]

06:20.380 --> 06:22.256
[clicks tongue]
I'm looking for the band.

06:23.549 --> 06:24.842
[phone rings]

06:29.013 --> 06:31.015
Yes? Oh, professor.

06:31.099 --> 06:33.267
[doctor] Oh, I checked on him
this morning.

06:33.351 --> 06:35.395
He didn't look well earlier today.

06:35.478 --> 06:37.105
He was very septic.

06:37.188 --> 06:38.356
He had a high fever,

06:38.439 --> 06:41.442
and his CRP level
was between five and ten.

06:41.526 --> 06:43.903
Yes. So we got a CT scan.

06:43.986 --> 06:46.322
I took a look at it,
and that looked very bad too.

06:46.406 --> 06:48.157
You said it could be endocytosis.

06:48.241 --> 06:51.452
I thought it may be better
to just operate instead.

06:51.536 --> 06:54.664
So I scheduled him
for a surgery this afternoon.

06:55.706 --> 06:56.749
Captain.

06:57.708 --> 06:58.793
Are you all right?

06:59.752 --> 07:01.629
[breathes heavily]
Hey.

07:02.463 --> 07:03.965
I almost died.

07:04.549 --> 07:05.425
[exhales deeply]

07:05.508 --> 07:07.677
- [Pildo] Well, do you want some water?
- No, I don't.

07:07.760 --> 07:08.970
[grunts]

07:09.053 --> 07:11.597
[breathing heavily]

07:11.681 --> 07:12.974
Detective Oh…

07:13.057 --> 07:14.934
[Pildo] We caught her.

07:15.017 --> 07:16.602
She did it. She stabbed you.

07:16.686 --> 07:18.521
- She's in the hospital--
- Pildo.

07:18.604 --> 07:20.106
[inhales sharply]

07:20.189 --> 07:21.607
- [sighs]
- [Pildo] Yeah?

07:23.609 --> 07:24.485
[clicks tongue]

07:25.736 --> 07:26.904
[sighs]

07:27.989 --> 07:29.115
You know…

07:31.033 --> 07:32.869
Yoon Donghoon, right?

07:33.536 --> 07:35.288
Yoon Donghoon of Dongcheon

07:35.371 --> 07:37.582
who was killed five years ago?

07:37.665 --> 07:38.708
Ah, yes.

07:39.333 --> 07:40.460
She is…

07:41.919 --> 07:44.464
[exhales deeply]
…Yoon Donghoon's daughter.

07:45.548 --> 07:48.092
[dramatic music]

07:49.594 --> 07:52.472
[lighter clinking]

07:59.061 --> 08:02.190
Yoon Donghoon's real name was Song Joonsu.

08:04.525 --> 08:05.485
I…

08:06.569 --> 08:09.572
Wait, the late Narcotics detective?

08:10.740 --> 08:11.699
[exhales deeply]

08:13.075 --> 08:14.535
He was undercover.

08:16.078 --> 08:17.288
[inhales sharply]

08:17.371 --> 08:19.457
I sent him into Dongcheon.

08:21.292 --> 08:22.460
[Cha Giho sighs]

08:24.754 --> 08:27.632
[doctor] I think our best option
is to get him in surgery today

08:27.715 --> 08:30.301
which is why I schedule him
for this afternoon.

08:31.177 --> 08:32.303
Yes.

08:33.513 --> 08:35.848
You don't need to worry about it.

08:35.932 --> 08:38.768
Yes, well, just in case…

08:38.851 --> 08:40.561
But I am almost done here.

08:40.645 --> 08:42.897
Once I finish, I'll check on him again.

08:42.980 --> 08:43.814
[clatters]

08:43.898 --> 08:45.816
Yes. Yes.

08:45.900 --> 08:47.109
[pants]

08:50.279 --> 08:52.698
[Cha Giho]
Jung Taeju is the one who stabbed me.

08:54.158 --> 08:56.244
[Pildo] I brought him home last night.

08:56.327 --> 08:59.163
He seemed nervous,
so I offered to stay, but he said no…

09:00.831 --> 09:02.291
It wasn't your fault.

09:05.503 --> 09:06.796
[Pildo] So it was Do Gangjae.

09:07.672 --> 09:09.423
The one you wanted to catch.

09:11.759 --> 09:14.554
You're doing this
because of your dad, right?

09:16.389 --> 09:17.682
[Cha Giho] Jiwoo…

09:18.683 --> 09:21.811
joined up with her dad's killer
to try and get revenge.

09:22.520 --> 09:25.022
[breathes heavily]

09:25.106 --> 09:27.775
Choi Mujin deceived her.

09:31.279 --> 09:32.822
[Gangjae] If I'm honest,

09:34.824 --> 09:36.367
will you believe me?

09:37.785 --> 09:38.995
[Jiwoo] Pildo.

09:41.622 --> 09:42.873
Thank you.

09:45.585 --> 09:47.587
[dramatic music continues]

09:52.091 --> 09:54.176
- Please finish up.
- Right.

09:58.264 --> 10:00.391
- Are you finished?
- [doctor] Yes. She'll be out shortly.

10:00.474 --> 10:01.475
Yeah.

10:08.608 --> 10:11.277
Take the side door and go down to B2.

10:11.861 --> 10:13.321
My car is there for you.

10:31.547 --> 10:32.673
This is good.

10:33.507 --> 10:34.925
I wanted to punch you.

10:37.553 --> 10:39.764
[all grunting]

10:39.847 --> 10:41.474
[clatters]

10:44.435 --> 10:46.020
- Argh!
- [gun clanking]

10:47.813 --> 10:49.398
- [yells]
- [groans]

10:50.107 --> 10:51.025
[grunts]

10:55.237 --> 10:56.947
[cell phone vibrates]

10:57.031 --> 10:57.948
Yeah?

10:58.032 --> 10:59.575
[Daesoo] Pildo.
[coughs]

10:59.659 --> 11:01.369
Hyejin got away.

11:14.340 --> 11:16.884
[tense music]

11:22.973 --> 11:23.974
[mutters]

11:53.045 --> 11:54.088
[car lock beeps]

12:11.731 --> 12:13.315
[engine starts]

12:14.191 --> 12:16.485
[tires screeching]

12:17.653 --> 12:18.904
[loud thud]

12:18.988 --> 12:20.239
[Pildo] Song Jiwoo!

12:26.412 --> 12:27.371
[Jiwoo grunts]

12:27.455 --> 12:29.165
No. No!

12:29.248 --> 12:30.124
Argh!

12:30.207 --> 12:32.293
- Song Jiwoo.
- [panting]

12:32.918 --> 12:34.253
That's your name, right?

12:35.504 --> 12:37.173
[Jiwoo panting]

12:37.798 --> 12:40.384
- [grunting]
- What do you plan to do?

12:40.468 --> 12:41.719
[panting]

12:41.802 --> 12:43.179
Are you going to Choi Mujin?

12:43.262 --> 12:45.389
[breathing heavily]

12:46.098 --> 12:47.725
The Captain told me.

12:47.808 --> 12:49.852
Did you let him go

12:49.935 --> 12:51.228
so you can kill him yourself?

12:53.355 --> 12:55.024
Yeah, so move.

12:55.107 --> 12:57.109
[grunting]

12:58.319 --> 12:59.487
No.

12:59.570 --> 13:00.863
I'll stop you.

13:01.697 --> 13:03.574
[both grunting]

13:06.118 --> 13:07.536
[Pildo] No.

13:07.620 --> 13:08.746
[Jiwoo grunts]

13:08.829 --> 13:09.830
Enough already!

13:09.914 --> 13:11.415
No!
[pants]

13:13.209 --> 13:14.710
You get it now.

13:14.794 --> 13:16.545
You must know why I'm doing this!

13:16.629 --> 13:18.339
[breathes heavily]

13:18.422 --> 13:19.340
I do.

13:21.383 --> 13:22.802
That's why I'm stopping you.

13:23.636 --> 13:25.054
No, you don't know

13:25.638 --> 13:27.264
how I got to this point.

13:29.850 --> 13:33.062
I threw away my future and my name
to catch that asshole!

13:34.730 --> 13:37.149
But he tricked me and I killed someone.

13:38.234 --> 13:40.653
If I don't kill him,
my life has no meaning.

13:40.736 --> 13:42.655
[breathes heavily]

13:43.405 --> 13:45.366
[yelling]

13:45.449 --> 13:47.368
[breathes heavily]

13:48.244 --> 13:50.371
Is this all your life is worth, huh?

13:52.581 --> 13:54.124
Get out of my way.

13:56.085 --> 13:57.044
[grunts]

13:57.545 --> 13:59.463
[clinking]

14:01.966 --> 14:04.718
How can I just let you go
and drive to your death?

14:06.053 --> 14:08.639
Even if you kill him,
you'll be utterly destroyed!

14:08.722 --> 14:10.224
Don't you get it?

14:10.307 --> 14:11.934
I don't care about that.

14:12.893 --> 14:14.061
Well, I do.

14:16.397 --> 14:18.482
Go! Enough!

14:18.566 --> 14:19.441
[yelps]

14:20.568 --> 14:21.569
Let go!

14:22.069 --> 14:23.821
- [alarm blaring]
- [yells]

14:23.904 --> 14:26.031
[tires screeching]

14:26.115 --> 14:26.949
[grunts]

14:27.032 --> 14:28.659
[tires screech]

14:30.077 --> 14:33.205
[car door opens, closes]

14:35.541 --> 14:36.876
[gangsters grunt]

14:43.048 --> 14:44.008
[Pildo] Get in.

14:45.259 --> 14:46.719
[grunts]

14:46.802 --> 14:47.970
[groans]

14:49.805 --> 14:51.807
- [gangster 1] Get them! Go after them!
- [engine revs]

14:53.517 --> 14:54.518
[gangster 1] Stop!

14:55.895 --> 14:58.105
[tires screeching]

14:58.188 --> 14:59.815
[engine rumbling]

15:02.318 --> 15:05.154
[security guards clamoring]

15:07.907 --> 15:09.491
[engine rumbles]

15:10.701 --> 15:12.453
- [horn honks]
- [tires screech]

15:15.956 --> 15:18.626
[engine revving]

15:24.965 --> 15:27.384
[tires screeching]

15:27.468 --> 15:29.929
[horns honking]

15:30.012 --> 15:33.015
[thrilling music]

15:33.098 --> 15:34.642
[horns honk]

15:34.725 --> 15:37.102
- [engine rumbling]
- [horns honking]

15:39.813 --> 15:41.315
[engine revs]

15:46.528 --> 15:47.529
- [thuds]
- [tires screech]

15:51.158 --> 15:52.826
- [tires screech]
- [Pildo] Shit.

15:55.037 --> 15:56.163
Hold on tight.

15:56.246 --> 15:57.206
[engine revs]

15:58.082 --> 15:59.833
[tires screech]

16:09.134 --> 16:10.052
[glass shatters]

16:11.720 --> 16:13.973
- [crashes]
- [horns honking]

16:14.056 --> 16:16.266
[honking continues]

16:21.021 --> 16:22.773
[cell phone vibrates]

16:24.733 --> 16:26.694
[vibrating continues]

16:30.656 --> 16:31.907
[Ms. Kang] We lost her.

16:32.658 --> 16:34.910
An officer took her and they disappeared.

16:42.459 --> 16:44.461
[tranquil music]

17:16.577 --> 17:18.328
[police siren wailing]

17:35.721 --> 17:37.723
[tranquil music continues]

17:40.684 --> 17:41.643
[clinks]

18:02.414 --> 18:04.416
[handcuffs rattling]

18:07.920 --> 18:08.921
[gasps]

18:16.720 --> 18:18.889
[handcuffs rattling]

18:18.972 --> 18:20.140
[breathes deeply]

18:21.475 --> 18:23.352
We got here earlier than we expected.

18:25.813 --> 18:28.107
You remember our beach plans, don't you?

18:32.111 --> 18:34.530
[waves splashing]

18:57.094 --> 18:58.554
[keys clinking]

19:12.568 --> 19:15.863
[Pildo] My friend who loves to surf
rent out this place long-term.

19:36.550 --> 19:39.219
[clattering]

19:50.480 --> 19:51.732
Let me see your cut.

19:52.858 --> 19:54.067
No, I'm fine.

19:59.615 --> 20:01.241
Hearing that makes me angry.

20:06.455 --> 20:07.497
Sit down.

20:12.127 --> 20:15.088
[fire crackling]

20:15.172 --> 20:17.382
[waves crashing]

20:32.022 --> 20:33.440
[breathes heavily]

20:39.780 --> 20:42.157
I started carrying a knife
after my sister died.

20:45.619 --> 20:47.913
I was determined to kill the bastard

20:49.456 --> 20:50.749
if I found him.

20:55.587 --> 20:57.756
[somber music]

21:04.972 --> 21:06.473
Every night, I dreamt…

21:07.849 --> 21:09.476
about killing the guy.

21:12.688 --> 21:14.147
And eventually,

21:14.856 --> 21:16.191
my face changed.

21:22.489 --> 21:25.701
I look like a murderer consumed with rage.

21:31.999 --> 21:32.916
I…

21:37.671 --> 21:39.339
I was hurting myself.

21:46.096 --> 21:47.848
Don't destroy yourself.

21:51.226 --> 21:52.269
[sobs]

21:53.061 --> 21:54.604
Don't move. Stay still.

22:31.767 --> 22:33.852
Don't struggle alone anymore.

22:36.646 --> 22:38.357
You can lean on me anytime.

22:40.776 --> 22:42.986
[tranquil music]

23:04.508 --> 23:07.177
["A Thought Is Haunting Me" by
Raphael Lake & Royal Baggs playing]

23:23.777 --> 23:28.198
♪ Every smile, every pain ♪

23:28.782 --> 23:33.078
♪ Every memory coming back again ♪

23:33.620 --> 23:35.205
♪ Pulling down ♪

23:35.288 --> 23:41.586
♪ I'm sick of holding on ♪

23:43.672 --> 23:46.007
♪ No more talking ♪

23:46.091 --> 23:48.552
♪ Nothing to say ♪

23:48.635 --> 23:53.348
♪ No use trying anyway ♪

23:53.432 --> 23:55.058
♪ Pulling down ♪

23:55.142 --> 24:01.648
♪ I want these worries gone ♪

24:03.275 --> 24:05.026
♪ What the hell ♪

24:05.110 --> 24:12.117
♪ Is even going on? ♪

24:13.618 --> 24:17.372
♪ Oh, oh-oh, oh, oh ♪

24:17.456 --> 24:19.833
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

24:19.916 --> 24:23.128
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

24:23.211 --> 24:27.048
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

24:27.132 --> 24:29.593
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

24:29.676 --> 24:31.845
♪ A thought is haunting ♪

24:31.928 --> 24:37.684
♪ Me ♪

24:42.898 --> 24:44.983
♪ The weight of the world ♪

24:45.066 --> 24:47.611
♪ The burning of days ♪

24:47.694 --> 24:52.574
♪ A heartbreaking sense
We're drifting slowly away ♪

24:52.657 --> 24:56.161
♪ Losing sight of love now ♪

24:56.244 --> 25:01.541
♪ What went wrong? ♪

25:02.501 --> 25:07.589
♪ Lay my head down and rest my mind ♪

25:07.672 --> 25:12.302
♪ Give up searching 'cause I cannot find ♪

25:12.385 --> 25:14.763
♪ The strength I need ♪

25:14.846 --> 25:20.685
♪ To keep on holding on ♪

25:22.562 --> 25:26.566
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

25:26.650 --> 25:29.152
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

25:29.236 --> 25:32.239
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

25:32.322 --> 25:36.535
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

25:36.618 --> 25:38.912
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

25:38.995 --> 25:42.624
♪ A thought is haunting me ♪

25:42.707 --> 25:46.086
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh ♪

25:46.169 --> 25:49.214
♪ Oh, oh, oh, oh… ♪

25:56.304 --> 25:59.057
Choi Mujin put a tattoo on my chest.

26:03.019 --> 26:04.604
I burned it off.

26:16.616 --> 26:19.286
You and I chose different directions.

26:25.166 --> 26:26.084
[sighs]

26:28.795 --> 26:30.046
Let's catch him…

26:31.590 --> 26:32.674
together.

26:38.388 --> 26:40.098
We'll fulfill your father's wish.

26:41.099 --> 26:43.059
Judging with the law
rather than killing him.

26:48.815 --> 26:51.735
Your father sacrificed his life for this.

26:54.571 --> 26:56.239
And now you can do it.

27:27.646 --> 27:31.691
BOW RESTAURANT

27:32.734 --> 27:33.902
- [Donghoon] Taeju!
- Hi.

27:33.985 --> 27:35.945
- Are the boys here yet?
- No, not yet.

27:36.029 --> 27:38.365
[store owner] Hi. Welcome. Come in.

27:38.448 --> 27:40.659
[Donghoon] Hungry for pork belly.

27:40.742 --> 27:41.910
[student 1 grunts]

27:41.993 --> 27:42.869
[student 2] Oh.

27:43.995 --> 27:45.413
- [student 2] Minjae, I'm sorry.
- [Donghoon] Get out of here.

27:45.497 --> 27:46.998
Hey, you.

27:48.166 --> 27:50.418
Go, huh? Go on and study.

27:50.502 --> 27:51.711
- [student 1 groans]
- Huh?

27:51.795 --> 27:53.046
I wanna join Dongcheon.

27:53.129 --> 27:55.048
- [Donghoon] Hey, stop.
- [Taeju] Take your bag.

27:55.131 --> 27:56.841
Hey, what grade are you? Get out of here.

27:56.925 --> 27:58.551
- [Mujin] Let him talk.
- What?

27:59.219 --> 28:00.804
What do you mean? He's a kid.

28:00.887 --> 28:02.180
[Mujin] Why do you wanna join?

28:03.640 --> 28:04.891
[pants]
Well…

28:05.475 --> 28:07.644
I wanna be cool like you guys.

28:07.727 --> 28:09.354
- [both chuckle]
- Seriously?

28:09.437 --> 28:10.563
[Mujin] Are you smart?

28:11.398 --> 28:12.607
[student 1] Yes, I am.

28:12.691 --> 28:14.943
Hey. Go and study then, okay?

28:15.026 --> 28:16.111
[student 1] I mean it, Boss.

28:16.194 --> 28:17.779
- You kids watch way too many movies.
- [student 1] Please accept me.

28:17.862 --> 28:18.697
No, you don't get it.

28:18.780 --> 28:20.281
- I can handle it.
- Hey, come on. Let's go.

28:21.199 --> 28:23.243
[soft guitar music]

28:30.041 --> 28:31.543
[clanks]

28:43.346 --> 28:46.808
[cell phone vibrating]

28:48.935 --> 28:51.855
[Taeju] Boss. Donghoon is at his place.

28:53.064 --> 28:55.191
[engine revving]

29:03.074 --> 29:05.076
[ominous music]

29:07.579 --> 29:08.663
[approaching footsteps]

29:13.418 --> 29:15.128
[breathes heavily]

29:15.211 --> 29:16.129
[gunshot]

29:17.380 --> 29:18.423
[Jiwoo] Papa!

29:19.424 --> 29:20.341
Papa!

29:20.425 --> 29:21.384
[breathes heavily]

29:21.468 --> 29:22.886
- [gunshot]
- [Donghoon groans]

29:24.304 --> 29:25.305
[Donghoon exhales sharply]

29:26.973 --> 29:28.850
- [Jiwoo] Papa!
- [pounding on door]

29:29.976 --> 29:32.896
- Papa!
- [lock clanking]

29:32.979 --> 29:34.856
[Donghoon] Jiwoo, don't come out!

29:34.939 --> 29:36.608
Please, don't come out.

29:37.275 --> 29:38.234
[Jiwoo] Open the door!

29:38.318 --> 29:39.402
[pounding on door]

29:40.820 --> 29:41.905
I…

29:43.198 --> 29:44.491
never once…

29:47.118 --> 29:49.788
betrayed someone who trusted in me.

29:52.040 --> 29:54.834
So why does everyone keep betraying me?

30:01.674 --> 30:02.801
Right…

30:04.302 --> 30:06.346
She wants to kill me now.

30:09.891 --> 30:11.184
That's why…

30:12.018 --> 30:14.354
[inhales sharply]
That's why…

30:15.855 --> 30:17.440
she should've come here.

30:26.199 --> 30:28.618
Right, Donghoon?
[chuckles]

30:29.661 --> 30:31.079
She should've come here.

30:34.999 --> 30:36.668
She should've come to me.

30:38.253 --> 30:40.630
[pants]
There's a warrant out for you.

30:41.548 --> 30:42.757
You must run away.

30:43.383 --> 30:45.134
They say they have a witness.

30:45.218 --> 30:46.719
It's must be Detective Oh.

30:46.803 --> 30:47.971
You need to run.

30:53.268 --> 30:55.812
You told me she would come to kill you.

30:56.604 --> 30:57.856
[Mujin] Exactly.

30:58.857 --> 31:00.692
She should've come here.

31:03.069 --> 31:04.237
She should've…

31:05.238 --> 31:06.531
- come to me!
- [screams]

31:06.614 --> 31:07.991
[glass shatters]

31:10.076 --> 31:12.078
She betrayed me
and went back to the police.

31:13.121 --> 31:14.247
[exhales deeply]

31:15.206 --> 31:17.417
[footsteps thudding]

31:17.500 --> 31:18.710
Sir, please wait.

31:19.502 --> 31:20.336
[beeps]

31:26.426 --> 31:28.761
Ever since I saved her
from dying on the street,

31:28.845 --> 31:30.388
her life belonged to me.

31:30.471 --> 31:31.848
[cocks gun]

31:31.931 --> 31:32.849
You need to stop this.

31:32.932 --> 31:33.808
I won't!

31:36.603 --> 31:37.979
I can't stop now.

31:39.647 --> 31:41.691
It's not something I can just stop now.

31:46.321 --> 31:48.615
It won't end until one of us is dead.

31:51.618 --> 31:52.619
Either I die…

31:55.538 --> 31:57.874
- [yelps]
- …or she dies.

31:57.957 --> 31:59.918
[Ms. Kang breathes shakily]

32:00.001 --> 32:01.169
[retreating footsteps]

32:01.252 --> 32:02.378
[Mujin] So, leave.

32:04.505 --> 32:05.632
Leave!

32:07.675 --> 32:09.969
[somber music]

33:05.692 --> 33:08.277
[waves lapping]

33:20.289 --> 33:21.332
[Donghoon] Jiwoo.

33:23.209 --> 33:24.836
You have to be happy

33:25.878 --> 33:29.382
and live a good life
even if I'm not around, okay?

33:34.804 --> 33:37.765
[waves lapping]

33:55.783 --> 33:56.868
[groans]

33:56.951 --> 33:59.162
[sighing]

34:17.013 --> 34:19.015
[waves splashing]

34:37.158 --> 34:38.743
[Jiwoo] Did you think I left?

34:40.453 --> 34:41.829
I got scared.

34:43.206 --> 34:44.665
"Don't be scared.

34:44.749 --> 34:46.250
We're cops, aren't we?"

34:47.502 --> 34:49.087
[chuckles]

34:55.343 --> 34:56.427
Let's go.

34:59.555 --> 35:01.724
[waves splashing]

35:18.491 --> 35:19.408
[lighter clinks]

35:30.044 --> 35:32.964
[car door opens, closes]

35:34.173 --> 35:35.424
[driver] Where to now, ma'am?

35:36.300 --> 35:37.885
Somewhere far away.

35:38.469 --> 35:40.263
Dongcheon is finished.

35:40.972 --> 35:42.181
[driver] Yes, ma'am.

35:42.265 --> 35:43.307
[puffs]

35:49.230 --> 35:53.776
[horns honking]

36:03.244 --> 36:05.329
[honking continues]

36:13.838 --> 36:15.089
It'll be hard.

36:16.465 --> 36:18.718
The entire world will be against you.

36:19.760 --> 36:21.846
After the trial, you'll be put away.

36:26.601 --> 36:27.602
I know.

36:31.564 --> 36:32.732
I'm ready.

36:40.281 --> 36:42.033
Whatever you go through,

36:43.576 --> 36:45.077
I'll be with you.

36:46.204 --> 36:48.789
[gentle music]

36:53.628 --> 36:55.755
[engine rumbling]

37:09.852 --> 37:11.395
[cocks gun]

37:12.396 --> 37:14.815
[suspenseful music]

37:17.818 --> 37:19.445
- [gunshot]
- [glass shatters]

37:25.201 --> 37:27.578
[somber music]

37:39.715 --> 37:41.550
[people screaming]

37:41.634 --> 37:43.511
[engine rumbling]

37:45.012 --> 37:47.223
[people clamoring]

37:50.810 --> 37:53.562
[indistinct shouting]

38:08.286 --> 38:09.620
Hey!

38:09.704 --> 38:11.080
Pildo!

38:12.873 --> 38:14.417
- No!
- Jeon Pildo!

38:14.500 --> 38:15.501
Pildo!

38:15.584 --> 38:16.585
No!

38:18.212 --> 38:19.505
[Daesoo] What happened?

38:20.089 --> 38:22.091
[somber music continues]

38:33.227 --> 38:35.313
[breathing heavily]

38:41.068 --> 38:43.070
[machine beeping]

39:02.423 --> 39:05.092
[Pildo] You will catch Choi Mujin.

39:05.676 --> 39:09.180
[fireworks crackling]

39:13.267 --> 39:15.644
[breathes deeply]

39:19.982 --> 39:20.983
[clicks]

39:27.990 --> 39:33.287
["My Name" playing]

39:40.378 --> 39:41.504
[Jiwoo] Open it.

39:42.671 --> 39:43.589
[door lock beeps]

39:44.882 --> 39:46.175
[door opens]

39:49.762 --> 39:50.596
[door closes]

39:53.391 --> 39:55.768
["My Name" continues playing]

39:57.812 --> 39:59.313
[indistinct shouting]

39:59.397 --> 40:00.398
- [gunshot]
- [man grunts]

40:00.481 --> 40:02.650
[people clamoring]

40:04.902 --> 40:05.778
[gangster 2 grunts]

40:06.529 --> 40:08.864
[grunting]

40:10.491 --> 40:12.410
- [men grunting]
- [gunshot]

40:16.080 --> 40:17.123
[groans]

40:24.880 --> 40:25.840
[grunts]

40:30.469 --> 40:32.388
[grunting]

40:36.434 --> 40:37.393
[groans]

40:40.229 --> 40:41.063
[knife clanks]

40:44.483 --> 40:45.484
- [gunshot]
- [grunts]

40:45.568 --> 40:48.863
["My Name" continues playing]

40:52.032 --> 40:53.534
[breathing heavily]

40:54.952 --> 40:55.953
[gasps]

40:56.620 --> 40:58.289
[gangster 3] Where is that bitch?
We gotta find her.

40:58.372 --> 40:59.707
[gangster 4] There she is.

40:59.790 --> 41:01.083
Whoa, whoa!

41:02.918 --> 41:05.004
[panting]

41:06.297 --> 41:08.924
["My Name" continues playing]

41:26.233 --> 41:29.445
["My Name" continues playing]

41:41.624 --> 41:42.541
[clicks]

41:51.008 --> 41:53.928
[bullets clinking]

41:59.642 --> 42:00.601
[clicks]

42:01.727 --> 42:03.729
[breathes heavily]

42:03.812 --> 42:05.981
[suspenseful music]

42:06.065 --> 42:07.274
[elevator bell dings]

42:08.234 --> 42:09.735
- [thwacks]
- [alarm blares]

42:09.818 --> 42:11.570
[music intensifies]

42:13.447 --> 42:14.448
[yells]

42:16.575 --> 42:17.576
[Jiwoo grunts]

42:20.162 --> 42:21.580
[gangster 5 yells]

42:26.293 --> 42:27.753
- [grunts]
- [Jiwoo groans]

42:30.965 --> 42:32.508
[yelps, groans]

42:35.719 --> 42:37.721
[gangsters groaning]

42:38.305 --> 42:39.974
[panting]

42:41.642 --> 42:43.269
[breathes heavily]

42:47.189 --> 42:48.148
[Jiwoo groans]

42:49.692 --> 42:50.651
Argh!

42:51.402 --> 42:52.528
[Jiwoo pants]

42:55.239 --> 42:56.198
[grunts]

43:00.286 --> 43:01.245
[yelps]

43:02.371 --> 43:03.372
Agh!

43:13.173 --> 43:14.341
[pants]

43:21.724 --> 43:22.975
[groans]

43:28.188 --> 43:29.148
[grunts]

43:36.238 --> 43:37.406
[groans]

43:38.407 --> 43:39.325
[gunshot]

43:39.950 --> 43:41.493
- [breathing heavily]
- [knife clanks]

43:47.166 --> 43:48.083
[groans]

43:53.380 --> 43:55.257
[panting]

44:05.851 --> 44:07.144
You look tired.

44:08.437 --> 44:09.521
It's bearable.

44:09.605 --> 44:11.482
[panting]

44:11.565 --> 44:13.067
I can still kill you.

44:14.026 --> 44:15.527
[guns clicking]

44:21.659 --> 44:23.702
Right. You should.

44:29.583 --> 44:31.210
Your father was a weak man.

44:33.420 --> 44:35.547
He had several chances to kill me,

44:36.590 --> 44:38.050
but he lacked courage.

44:41.512 --> 44:43.180
He was born to be prey.

44:53.190 --> 44:54.024
His hesitation…

44:55.192 --> 44:56.193
…made so that…

44:57.486 --> 44:58.529
you…

45:01.365 --> 45:04.535
me, and the policeman,
we've all been miserable.

45:05.953 --> 45:06.787
[gulps]

45:06.870 --> 45:08.747
[breathes heavily]

45:11.333 --> 45:12.626
But you are different.

45:14.628 --> 45:16.130
You acted without fear.

45:20.217 --> 45:21.552
So why?

45:24.096 --> 45:26.223
Haven't you been waiting for this moment?

45:27.683 --> 45:28.767
So why?

45:30.644 --> 45:32.062
Why did you hesitate?

45:35.482 --> 45:36.608
[gun clanks]

45:41.071 --> 45:43.073
[somber music]

45:49.872 --> 45:51.498
[scoffs]

45:54.084 --> 45:55.461
That's right, I did.

45:59.298 --> 46:01.425
I wanted to live like a human.

46:02.342 --> 46:04.511
[sobs]

46:09.057 --> 46:11.935
You asked if I wanted revenge
no matter what.

46:13.145 --> 46:15.481
I didn't know what you meant back then.

46:16.023 --> 46:17.024
[sobs]

46:18.901 --> 46:20.068
I do now.

46:23.947 --> 46:26.200
To take revenge is to become a monster.

46:26.283 --> 46:27.284
[photo rustles]

46:27.367 --> 46:29.536
A monster is what you are.

46:42.132 --> 46:43.300
That's right.

46:47.095 --> 46:48.597
You're a lot like me.

46:50.766 --> 46:52.142
Can you become…

46:55.312 --> 46:56.396
a monster?

47:00.150 --> 47:01.902
[Jiwoo] Because I hesitated,

47:04.446 --> 47:06.865
another person precious to me died.

47:07.574 --> 47:10.536
[Jiwoo whimpering]

47:11.453 --> 47:13.163
Someone who understood.

47:15.207 --> 47:17.751
He was somebody said I could rely on.

47:20.879 --> 47:22.589
[whimpers]

47:26.677 --> 47:27.928
I will become…

47:28.846 --> 47:29.805
[scoffs]

47:31.098 --> 47:32.349
…a monster.

47:36.645 --> 47:38.146
And I will take pleasure

47:38.230 --> 47:41.316
into watching you breathe
your very last breath.

47:41.400 --> 47:42.943
[music stops]

47:45.195 --> 47:46.738
[inhale deeply]

47:46.822 --> 47:47.906
[grunts]

47:50.075 --> 47:51.201
[panting]

47:56.164 --> 47:57.583
[Jiwoo breathes heavily]

48:04.172 --> 48:05.340
[Jiwoo grunts]

48:08.135 --> 48:09.428
- [groans]
- [glass shatters]

48:12.264 --> 48:13.265
Argh!

48:14.641 --> 48:15.559
[grunts]

48:16.059 --> 48:17.811
Can you kill me in the state you're in?

48:19.062 --> 48:21.106
[groans, pants]

48:22.482 --> 48:23.609
Very good.

48:26.153 --> 48:27.154
[grunts]

48:32.618 --> 48:33.493
[Jiwoo yelps]

48:34.411 --> 48:35.579
[moans]

48:37.164 --> 48:38.457
[Jiwoo groans]

48:48.759 --> 48:51.470
[slow upbeat music]

49:07.527 --> 49:08.987
[grunts]

49:12.658 --> 49:13.533
[Jiwoo groans]

49:19.957 --> 49:21.041
[hisses]

49:22.209 --> 49:23.126
[knife clanks]

49:29.466 --> 49:31.134
[groaning]

49:31.843 --> 49:32.928
Get up.

49:33.595 --> 49:35.430
- [yelps]
- That's right.

49:35.514 --> 49:37.349
[panting]

49:37.432 --> 49:38.850
- [knife slashes]
- [Jiwoo] Argh!

49:39.476 --> 49:41.395
[groaning]

49:43.355 --> 49:44.940
- [body thuds]
- [groans in pain]

49:45.023 --> 49:46.525
[Mujin] Get up!

49:47.609 --> 49:48.610
[groans]

49:49.695 --> 49:50.946
Stab me!

49:51.029 --> 49:53.407
[Jiwoo breathing heavily]

49:55.242 --> 49:56.243
[groans]

49:56.326 --> 49:57.285
[Mujin] Again.

49:57.369 --> 49:59.663
[panting]

50:00.831 --> 50:02.082
That's right.

50:04.292 --> 50:05.460
- Get up.
- [Jiwoo groans]

50:07.295 --> 50:10.173
[breathing heavily]

50:10.257 --> 50:12.551
It won't end until one of us dies.

50:16.805 --> 50:17.806
[grunts]

50:19.391 --> 50:21.309
[squelching]

50:25.105 --> 50:26.314
[Mujin groans]

50:27.816 --> 50:28.817
[Jiwoo groans]

50:30.569 --> 50:31.862
[knife clanks]

50:34.489 --> 50:35.657
[chuckles]

50:48.462 --> 50:49.379
[groans]

50:49.463 --> 50:52.299
[chuckling]

50:53.008 --> 50:53.967
[Jiwoo groans]

50:54.051 --> 50:56.845
- [Mujin sighing]
- [Jiwoo breathing heavily]

51:02.309 --> 51:03.393
[Mujin] The temple.

51:05.395 --> 51:06.605
Upper lip.

51:08.982 --> 51:10.025
Chin.

51:11.318 --> 51:12.360
Chest.

51:14.488 --> 51:16.323
- Do it.
- [Jiwoo groans]

51:19.201 --> 51:20.535
Stab me.

51:20.619 --> 51:21.703
[groans]

51:22.996 --> 51:24.247
Stab me!

51:27.250 --> 51:28.210
Come on!

51:28.293 --> 51:30.045
[Jiwoo breathes heavily]

51:33.340 --> 51:34.257
[groans]

51:36.551 --> 51:38.136
[breathes heavily]

51:39.221 --> 51:40.597
It's over for you.

51:41.932 --> 51:44.101
[panting]

51:45.143 --> 51:46.269
Accept it.

51:47.813 --> 51:51.149
You cannot… become a monster.

51:52.526 --> 51:53.360
[yells]

51:53.443 --> 51:54.319
[clicking]

51:54.861 --> 51:56.154
[squelching]

51:57.280 --> 51:58.281
[clicks]

52:00.033 --> 52:03.995
[Jiwoo whimpering]

52:04.663 --> 52:05.747
[squelches]

52:09.417 --> 52:10.710
[Mujin breathes shakily]

52:14.464 --> 52:15.882
[groans softly]

52:15.966 --> 52:17.008
[grunts]

52:28.019 --> 52:29.062
[gun thuds]

52:30.689 --> 52:33.191
[groaning]

52:37.237 --> 52:38.697
[exhales deeply]

52:39.322 --> 52:40.448
[Jiwoo groans]

52:41.783 --> 52:42.868
[Jiwoo pants]

52:54.421 --> 52:56.506
[dramatic music]

53:35.921 --> 53:38.632
[police siren blaring]

54:08.453 --> 54:10.205
[breathing heavily]

54:30.016 --> 54:33.895
DECEASED, KIM JEONGA

54:36.898 --> 54:39.484
["My Name" playing]

55:00.755 --> 55:03.883
TO DAD, FROM SONG JIWOO

55:08.096 --> 55:13.101
SONG JOONSU AND KIM JEONGA'S
FAMILY GRAVE

55:17.314 --> 55:20.775
♪ Oh, oh-oh, oh, oh ♪

55:22.319 --> 55:27.032
♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

55:28.742 --> 55:31.703
♪ Oh, oh-oh, oh, oh ♪

55:31.786 --> 55:34.289
[inaudible]

55:37.459 --> 55:42.839
♪ Oh, my past look so blurry ♪

55:44.174 --> 55:47.677
♪ Nobody ♪

55:47.761 --> 55:50.138
♪ No one is safe ♪

55:50.221 --> 55:56.186
JEON FAMILY GRAVE:
JEON PILDO, JEON DAEUN

55:56.269 --> 55:58.271
[rain pattering]

55:59.356 --> 56:03.068
["My Name" continues playing]

56:06.071 --> 56:08.156
[upbeat music]

56:08.239 --> 56:11.785
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

56:11.868 --> 56:14.788
♪ Oh-oh-oh ♪

56:15.538 --> 56:18.792
["My Name" continues playing]
